    "2026-04-28 用户确认新增归并：1810->S1810；11004->SK-11004；1713/QY1713->SK-1713-4；7028->SK-7028；QY185/LQ185->SK-185；102/KJ-102三角形->KJ-102；冰箱->PA4-6L；999->SK-999；1924->SK-1924；961->SM-961；1928->SK-1928；025->HS-025；LQ杆式吸尘器->SK-3378；SK-04029意式咖啡机->SK-04029半自动意式咖啡机；补充 SK-JFB-794 完整别名。",
    "2026-05-03 user confirmed: standalone ice maker product name must be normalized into SK-03038 ice maker canonical SKU."
